# Per-node overrides and anything carrying credentials never belong here.
# govexy-node.conf IS tracked: it holds infrastructure addresses and tuning that
# both nodes must share, and a value diverging between nodes is exactly the
# failure this repository exists to make visible. Secrets live in the
# application's .env, which is not managed from here.
*.local
*.local.conf
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.log
